  "description": "<p>It is possible to create a new datastream terminating in .xml - eg file.xml</p>\n\n<p>The html page for this datastream is unobtainable -&gt; eg /objects/pid/datastreams/file.xml  as it incorrectly looks for a datastream without the .xml eg 'file' and states that 'file' doesn't exist.</p>\n\n<p>/objects/pid/datastreams/file.xml.xml does resolve to the xml version of the file.xml ds properties.</p>\n",
